      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. As written, it is about twice the maximum daily ibuprofen dose.\n\n- **Dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under supervision, and 1,200 mg/day for OTC use.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. The risk is real even with normal kidney function.\n\nWas this a typo? Some possible intended orders are:\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- 400\u2013800 mg PO three times daily\n- 1600 mg total per day, divided into doses\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and add a note with the clinical rationale. I'll enter it with that note. Otherwise, give me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it right away."
      }
